(Grabbing)

2077
01:20:58,993 --> 01:21:00,003
Grab this too.

2078
01:21:00,633 --> 01:21:02,802
- Go at once. - One, two, go.

2079
01:21:02,803 --> 01:21:03,803
That's it.

2080
01:21:03,804 --> 01:21:06,103
(Slipping)

2081
01:21:06,643 --> 01:21:07,842
I haven't fallen.

2082
01:21:07,843 --> 01:21:09,442
(I haven't fallen.)

2083
01:21:09,443 --> 01:21:11,272
- What? You fell. - No, I didn't fall.

2084
01:21:11,273 --> 01:21:12,743
- What was that? - I didn't fall.

2085
01:21:13,883 --> 01:21:15,543
(Struggling)

2086
01:21:15,713 --> 01:21:16,883
How do I go from here?

2087
01:21:18,113 --> 01:21:20,383
(Flailing)

2088
01:21:20,923 --> 01:21:22,082
He's playing escape room by himself.

2089
01:21:22,083 --> 01:21:23,392
(He got another life, but it's not easy to go forward.)

2090
01:21:23,393 --> 01:21:24,723
Gosh, he's having so much fun.

2091
01:21:25,693 --> 01:21:27,893
(Chuckling)

2092
01:21:28,493 --> 01:21:30,893
(He's not sure if he's laughing or crying.)

2093
01:21:31,293 --> 01:21:32,362
Let's go back!

2094
01:21:32,363 --> 01:21:34,433
(Unable to move)

2095
01:21:37,833 --> 01:21:40,742
(In the end, he falls off the cliff.)

2096
01:21:40,743 --> 01:21:41,773
He died.

2097
01:21:43,613 --> 01:21:44,672
I died.

2098
01:21:44,673 --> 01:21:46,913
(Crying)

2099
01:21:48,183 --> 01:21:49,913
I can't cross this part.

2100
01:21:50,283 --> 01:21:52,153
I was really tired then.

2101
01:21:53,783 --> 01:21:56,552
(Exhausted)

2102
01:21:56,553 --> 01:21:57,592
Oh, no.

2103
01:21:57,593 --> 01:21:59,562
(Groaning)

2104
01:21:59,563 --> 01:22:00,593
I'm having cramps.

2105
01:22:02,463 --> 01:22:04,092
(Fortunately, he can still feel his leg.)

2106
01:22:04,093 --> 01:22:05,163
I got cramps.

2107
01:22:06,563 --> 01:22:11,133
(Save me.)

2108
01:22:12,673 --> 01:22:14,943
I can do it. Hold on.

2109
01:22:15,443 --> 01:22:17,212
Still... Hold on. I should do this.

2110
01:22:17,213 --> 01:22:18,343
(Getting up)

2111
01:22:19,483 --> 01:22:21,242
(He suddenly revived.)

2112
01:22:21,243 --> 01:22:23,053
- You didn't give up. - No.

2113
01:22:23,313 --> 01:22:24,353
Okay.

2114
01:22:25,753 --> 01:22:27,983
(Giving another try for the dream he didn't fulfill)

2115
01:22:29,083 --> 01:22:30,893
Okay, I got it.

2116
01:22:31,393 --> 01:22:34,463
Great. Great posture. This is it.

2117
01:22:35,193 --> 01:22:37,633
(Back in reform after he revived)

2118
01:22:38,633 --> 01:22:40,503
(Grabbing without hesitation)

2119
01:22:42,133 --> 01:22:43,202
Oh, no!

2120
01:22:43,203 --> 01:22:44,802
- Grab that. - That's it.

2121
01:22:44,803 --> 01:22:46,403
(But he overcame the crisis.)

2122
01:22:47,543 --> 01:22:49,713
Taking that one step wasn't easy.

2123
01:22:50,643 --> 01:22:53,613
(Only if I pass this part...)

2124
01:22:54,313 --> 01:22:58,453
(Taking each step slowly)

2125
01:22:59,383 --> 01:23:01,582
If you finish it, it gives you a great sense of achievement.

2126
01:23:01,583 --> 01:23:02,623
Yes.

2127
01:23:04,253 --> 01:23:09,493
(It's his last step already.)

2128
01:23:11,663 --> 01:23:13,202
Yes, do it until the end. He's almost there.

2129
01:23:13,203 --> 01:23:14,402
- You're almost there. - He's almost there.

2130
01:23:14,403 --> 01:23:17,773
(He finally managed to climb Mount Deverest.)

2131
01:23:18,033 --> 01:23:20,143
(I made it!)

2132
01:23:20,803 --> 01:23:22,302
(He rummages through something right away?)

2133
01:23:22,303 --> 01:23:23,423
- What is it? - What's that?

2134
01:23:23,543 --> 01:23:24,573
What is it?

2135
01:23:25,243 --> 01:23:26,582
There must be something. He's doing something.

2136
01:23:26,583 --> 01:23:28,543
- It's my true dream. - Oh, really?

2137
01:23:30,713 --> 01:23:33,053
- You're hanging yourself there. - Oh, to do that?

2138
01:23:33,983 --> 01:23:36,753
(Going down)

2139
01:23:38,223 --> 01:23:42,493
(Hanging just like that)

2140
01:23:43,033 --> 01:23:45,133
Nana?

2141
01:23:47,103 --> 01:23:48,262
- Is it Churu? - Is it his snack?

2142
01:23:48,263 --> 01:23:49,373
- Nana's snack. - Nana?

2143
01:23:50,373 --> 01:23:51,373
Nana.

2144
01:23:52,873 --> 01:23:53,873
Nana.

2145
01:23:54,543 --> 01:23:55,603
Let's have this.

2146
01:23:57,173 --> 01:23:58,173
Come here.

2147
01:23:59,643 --> 01:24:00,712
Come here.

2148
01:24:00,713 --> 01:24:03,813
(He managed to lure him with a snack.)

2149
01:24:04,253 --> 01:24:05,283
Come here.

2150
01:24:07,683 --> 01:24:08,782
(Thinking)

2151
01:24:08,783 --> 01:24:09,853
Come up here.

2152
01:24:10,523 --> 01:24:11,523
That's it.

2153
01:24:11,523 --> 01:24:12,523
(Jumping)

2154
01:24:12,524 --> 01:24:13,663
Nana, come here.

2155
01:24:14,493 --> 01:24:16,262
- Come here. - You wanted to be with him.

2156
01:24:16,263 --> 01:24:17,333
That's it.

2157
01:24:19,333 --> 01:24:20,963
I wanted to do this with you.

2158
01:24:22,903 --> 01:24:24,202
He's having a beer.

2159
01:24:24,203 --> 01:24:25,272
Alcohol is not allowed in the mountains,

2160
01:24:25,273 --> 01:24:26,619
- so it's a raisin tree tea. - Right.

2161
01:24:26,643 --> 01:24:27,902
- A raisin tree tea? - Yes, a raisin tree tea.

2162
01:24:27,903 --> 01:24:28,973
A raisin tree tea.

2163
01:24:29,843 --> 01:24:31,812
(Enjoying the climb with a refreshing raisin tree tea)

2164
01:24:31,813 --> 01:24:34,053
It's not coming out because the can was squeezed, right?

2165
01:24:34,413 --> 01:24:36,082
- Because I fell... - Right?

2166
01:24:36,083 --> 01:24:37,803
- It didn't come out. - The can is a bit...

2167
01:24:38,553 --> 01:24:41,752
(Even though the tea didn't come out well...)

2168
01:24:41,753 --> 01:24:42,853
Nice view.

2169
01:24:43,123 --> 01:24:45,253
Dae Ho is really imaginative.

2170
01:24:45,653 --> 01:24:46,722
Next time, you should put on...

2171
01:24:46,723 --> 01:24:47,999
- VR goggles next time. - That's right.

2172
01:24:48,023 --> 01:24:49,532
- The VR for cliffs. - That's right.

2173
01:24:49,533 --> 01:24:50,773
(That sounds like a good idea.)

2174
01:24:50,933 --> 01:24:53,033
When I reached the finish line,

2175
01:24:53,133 --> 01:24:55,803
there was something I wanted to do.

2176
01:24:55,933 --> 01:25:00,373
That was just me hanging without relying on a hold...

2177
01:25:00,703 --> 01:25:03,643
and enjoying a happy moment with Nana.

2178
01:25:04,173 --> 01:25:06,582
Fulfilling your own dream is really...

2179
01:25:06,583 --> 01:25:07,919
(Sharing a happy moment with Nana)

2180
01:25:07,943 --> 01:25:09,582
It only takes five steps to get there.

2181
01:25:09,583 --> 01:25:11,152
But I used an hour to climb.

2182
01:25:11,153 --> 01:25:12,153
(Laughing)

2183
01:25:12,154 --> 01:25:15,353
Still, I'm glad I reached the end. I'm so proud of it.

2184
01:25:15,723 --> 01:25:17,723
I fell after two steps,

2185
01:25:18,023 --> 01:25:20,023
but I took three steps after overcoming it.

2186
01:25:20,393 --> 01:25:22,762
Turning the corner and reaching the end.

2187
01:25:22,763 --> 01:25:25,163
The thrill it gave me was incredible.

2188
01:25:25,493 --> 01:25:27,833
I think my place's climbing route isn't so bad.

2189
01:25:28,163 --> 01:25:30,103
I'll turn it into an indoor climbing gym,

2190
01:25:30,273 --> 01:25:32,073
so anyone can come.

2191
01:25:32,973 --> 01:25:34,472
I'll provide drinks too.

2192
01:25:34,473 --> 01:25:35,473
(Considering)

2193
01:25:35,673 --> 01:25:39,912
I'm torn between wanting to go and not wanting to go.

2194
01:25:39,913 --> 01:25:41,212
- I'm still contemplating. - You keep debating, right?

2195
01:25:41,213 --> 01:25:42,412
He's a competitive type.

2196
01:25:42,413 --> 01:25:43,912
- But I do want to give it a try. - You want to try going once?

2197
01:25:43,913 --> 01:25:45,653
- Right? - I was moved.

2198
01:25:48,253 --> 01:25:50,792
- Dae Ho lives the happiest. - Seriously. He's the best.

2199
01:25:50,793 --> 01:25:52,423
You must do whatever you want.

2200
01:25:52,653 --> 01:25:55,922
You hold on to romance in your heart to the very end.

2201
01:25:55,923 --> 01:25:57,793
- I wanted to try it. - That's amazing.

2202
01:25:59,363 --> 01:26:01,932
(After enjoying the view fully...)

2203
01:26:01,933 --> 01:26:03,873
(Falling)

2204
01:26:04,673 --> 01:26:07,202
(1 hour of romance was sweet.)

2205
01:26:07,203 --> 01:26:08,742
You're still not defeated by time.

2206
01:26:08,743 --> 01:26:10,013
(1 hour of romance was sweet.)

2207
01:26:11,473 --> 01:26:14,112
(A Life in Pursuit of Romance)

2208
01:26:14,113 --> 01:26:15,743
(Next story)

2209
01:26:16,083 --> 01:26:17,753
(My shoes were in the living room.)

2210
01:26:18,613 --> 01:26:22,183
(The living room is a mess.)

2211
01:26:22,623 --> 01:26:24,793
(Moomoo's house was robbed?)

2212
01:26:25,293 --> 01:26:27,523
You little punk.

2213
01:26:29,493 --> 01:26:31,062
(Moomoo's good son project)

2214
01:26:31,063 --> 01:26:32,063
(Part 2)

2215
01:26:32,963 --> 01:26:34,562
(He gave the lucky dog...)

2216
01:26:34,563 --> 01:26:36,203
(to his parents instead of a grandchild.)

2217
01:26:36,603 --> 01:26:39,043
(A new family member he brought from a difficult environment)

2218
01:26:39,273 --> 01:26:41,743
(A baby dog who's only 70 days old)

2219
01:26:42,103 --> 01:26:44,213
(What should I name you?)

2220
01:26:44,343 --> 01:26:45,343
(Snowy)

2221
01:26:45,344 --> 01:26:46,382
(Yeolmu)

2222
01:26:46,383 --> 01:26:47,413
(Baekseolgi)

2223
01:26:47,883 --> 01:26:49,883
(I don't like them at all!)

2224
01:26:50,453 --> 01:26:52,453
(Should I name you this?)

2225
01:26:52,883 --> 01:26:55,323
(It's no different from raising a child.)

2226
01:26:56,083 --> 01:26:57,323
(Biting)

2227
01:26:57,623 --> 01:26:59,393
(Save Fathermoo!)

2228
01:26:59,793 --> 01:27:00,793
(No.)

2229
01:27:00,794 --> 01:27:01,862
(Come here.)

2230
01:27:01,863 --> 01:27:03,263
(You can't eat that.)

2231
01:27:03,833 --> 01:27:05,493
(I can't go on anymore.)

2232
01:27:05,933 --> 01:27:08,103
(Old Fathermoo is out of energy.)

2233
01:27:09,033 --> 01:27:11,773
(Fathermoo's Parenting Diary)

2234
01:27:12,173 --> 01:27:13,403
What is this? What do I do?

2235
01:27:14,473 --> 01:27:16,443
(Kang Yong is finally moving.)

2236
01:27:16,973 --> 01:27:20,613
(Even getting a deposit loan is already a struggle.)

2237
01:27:21,043 --> 01:27:22,683
(He checks out houses without giving up.)

2238
01:27:23,353 --> 01:27:25,582
(It wasn't easy...)

2239
01:27:25,583 --> 01:27:28,183
(to look for a new house.)

2240
01:27:28,883 --> 01:27:31,593
(The day of moving, leaving the house he cherished)

2241
01:27:32,123 --> 01:27:34,393
(He finally found his dream house.)

2242
01:27:35,593 --> 01:27:38,863
(Kang Yong's new house with the best location)

2243
01:27:39,463 --> 01:27:42,803
(He borrowed as much as 120,000 dollars.)

2244
01:27:43,233 --> 01:27:45,133
(The new house is nice.)

2245
01:27:45,403 --> 01:27:46,743
When will I finish organizing?

2246
01:27:48,273 --> 01:27:49,373
(Sighing)

2247
01:27:49,543 --> 01:27:51,443
(Why does it come down by itself?)

2248
01:27:51,813 --> 01:27:54,383
(Something's gone wrong with the upper cabinet.)

2249
01:27:54,983 --> 01:27:57,052
(Why is it so hard...)

2250
01:27:57,053 --> 01:27:59,383
(to get to the dining table?)

2251
01:28:01,183 --> 01:28:03,122
(On top of everything else, the power went out?)

2252
01:28:03,123 --> 01:28:05,193
(Crying)

2253
01:28:05,593 --> 01:28:07,522
(It's dark.)

2254
01:28:07,523 --> 01:28:08,893
(I miss Mom.)

2255
01:28:09,833 --> 01:28:13,063
(I Need to Become Stronger)
